<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'About Us' }) %>
  <style>
    .about-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #60a5fa, #38bdf8);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .about-hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .about-content {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 3rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin: 3rem 0;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .tech-stack-section {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      margin: 3rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .tech-badges {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .tech-pill {
      background: var(--light-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--dark);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .cta-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 3rem 0;
    }
    .cta-banner h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .cta-banner p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .btn-cta {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--primary);
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    .btn-cta:hover {
      background: #f8fafc;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .about-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
      .tech-stack-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar', { activePage: 'about' }) %>

  <main>
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>About Code Playground</h1>
      <p>Building the next generation of competitive programming, coding interview preparation, and collaborative learning.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i></div>
          <h3>In-Browser Code Execution</h3>
          <p>Powered by the Monaco Editor (the engine behind VS Code) and a robust cloud execution sandbox supporting Python, C++, Java, and C with instant feedback.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i></div>
          <h3>Real-Time Contests & Ratings</h3>
          <p>Compete against peers in timed challenges with live score updates, dynamic leaderboard recalculation, and automated rating progressions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-database"></i></div>
          <h3>Rich Problem Bank</h3>
          <p>Diverse curated problems spanning Data Structures, Algorithms, Dynamic Programming, Graphs, and Math with comprehensive test case verification.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
          <h3>Community Discussions</h3>
          <p>Ask questions, share multiple approaches, vote on constructive answers, and learn from a supportive community of aspiring engineers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-stack-section">
        <h2>Built with Modern Technologies</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;">Optimized for performance, security, responsiveness, and rapid serverless deployment.</p>
        <div class="tech-badges">
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fab fa-node-js" style="color: #68a063;"></i> Node.js & Express</span>
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fas fa-database" style="color: #47a248;"></i> MongoDB & Mongoose</span>
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fas fa-code" style="color: #007acc;"></i> Monaco Editor</span>
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fas fa-box" style="color: #e34c26;"></i> Piston Sandboxed Execution</span>
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fas fa-key" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i> JWT & BCrypt Security</span>
          <span class="tech-pill"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt" style="color: #2563eb;"></i> Responsive EJS + Modern CSS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-banner">
        <h2>Ready to Level Up Your Coding?</h2>
        <p>Join Code Playground today to start solving problems and competing in upcoming contests.</p>
        <a href="/problems" class="btn-cta">Start Solving Problems</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
